cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CZ Silicon Melt CFD Reference Dataset - Crucible Rotation Sweep"
abstract: >
  CFD reference dataset for Czochralski (CZ) silicon melt growth, covering
  crucible rotation from -1 to -10 rpm across 12 cases. All cases use the
  same anchor point (crystal 8 rpm, crucible -3 rpm, hot wall 1745 K) and
  were checked for convergence, mesh independence, conservation, and physical
  consistency. The data was generated as reference input for a PINN and
  surrogate model being developed under the Quasi / SIMD project.
  Simulated using ANSYS Fluent 2026 R1.
